      <title>Cloudflare Wallets 迟来入局 x402：支出控制仅能约束单笔支付</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/Cloudflare-Wallets-%E8%BF%9F%E6%9D%A5%E5%85%A5%E5%B1%80-x402%E6%94%AF%E5%87%BA%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%85%E8%83%BD%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%8D%95%E7%AC%94%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98/</link>
